{"version":"1.0.0","enabled":true,"name":"Schema & Contract Sync Guard","description":"When backend schemas or API contracts change, ensure the full chain stays in sync.","when":{"type":"fileEdited","patterns":["backend/**/schemas.py","contracts/**/*.yaml","contracts/**/*.json"]},"then":{"type":"askAgent","prompt":"A schema or contract file was modified. Complete the sync chain:\n1. If schemas.py changed: update the matching OpenAPI contract in contracts/ and the mobile DTOs in mobile/.../shared/models/.\n2. If a contract changed: update backend schemas.py to match and regenerate mobile DTOs.\n3. Verify: all new fields have Pydantic constraints (ge, le, min_length). Input models use extra='forbid'.\n4. Verify: no breaking changes to existing response shapes (field removals or type changes) without explicit confirmation.\n5. If a new endpoint was added: ensure it's registered in the api/v1/router.py."}}